        "params": {
          "text": "MASS_SPRING_DAMPER / EULER\nDefault dt=0.001 s (1 kHz); run 10 s, resonance 30 s. Open Scope.\nEquations, units, experiments and limits: examples/linear/README.md.\nState at runtime step k represents (k-1)*dt; Scope labels k*dt.\nExperimental teaching model; manual Studio workflow not yet qualified.",
